# SYNTHETIC test fixture written for DELFIN -- not ORCA output
#
# CI stand-in for the real [Ru(NH3)6]2+ PBE/def2-TZVP CPCM(water) single
# point, whose ORCA 6.1.1 output lives in the private fixture store
# (LICENSE_GUARD.md rule family 2: real licensed-program output is not
# committed).  The quoted lines below are transcribed verbatim from that
# real run (job "Ru(NH3)6 real run", 51 s, 2 cores): the def2-ECP was
# auto-loaded for Ru (Z=44 >= Rb) by the global def2-TZVP keyword, which is
# the behaviour delfin/tools/orca_basis_solv_opi.py relies on for its
# global-basis path.
#
# Shapes here follow ORCA's real format so tests can exercise the reader,
# but no number is a computed value except where the comment says it is
# transcribed from the real run.

